            "notes": "## Prioritize: \n [Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d) |\n\n## Extra money:\n\nIf possible, try to get  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) since its the cheapest extra AP item.\nor just get  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and/or  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) \n\n## How to play:\n\nNow THIS is your big spike. you have 31m range on your whipshot. **SO PLEASE USE THAT RANGE TO PLAY SAFE.**\n\nThe further the target, the more the damage. so focus on  [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546) 's on the highground. or  [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) 's trying to play safely. 1 whip is all it takes for them to pretty much be useless for 4 seconds because of the amount of damage 1 whip's done to them.\n\nBut if your tank is getting mogged by the enemy tank, then try to help them out by whipping the tank. (unless its  [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85)  cause that cow doesn't give a bleep :P)\n\n- TLDR: Whip people out of high grounds. if enemy tank is winning vs your tank, then focus their tank with whips. (AND DONT FORGET TO PACK!)",
